  "adaptations": [
    "Checked per-client membership replaces TeamMgr ID-linked records; counts/totals are world-owned and reset at original PreStartWorld.",
    "Portable server RandomInt replaces C rand modulo, preserving one draw per tie and strict >50 selection; no retail RNG-bit parity claim.",
    "Original team+4 skin and random-ordinal cyclic own/neutral spawn scan, with source first-marker fallback and existing checked placement.",
    "Player/team frags update atomically inside current +/-1000000 transport bounds. Departure retains team totals.",
    "Source sender/owner/self friendly-fire priorities, Voodoo protected-hit and slow-death finishing order retained without relaxing typed damage attribution.",
    "Existing ctf_team storage carries the original team ID; local CTF capture score and upcoming network CTF/OnlyFlagScores remain separate.",
    "Protocol 16 and Bloodbath-only network admission unchanged; Team transport, match limits, rotation retention and presentation are next."
  ]
